    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Imagine your life in our COLONY on MARS. Imagine all that you could achieve on MARS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mars Clicker</strong> is a game where you embark on a mission to accumulate a gigantic amount of crystals on Mars. To help you on this adventure, you can unlock and upgrade a variety of Martian buildings, from simple mines and mining plants to advanced technologies and mysterious alien structures - you'll even have the chance to investigate the enigmatic dark matter to boost your progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gather crystals and use them to produce even <strong>more crystals</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Research dark matter to unlock new powers   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Recruit mining robots and Martian entities  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock permanent upgrades  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive soundtrack </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And remember, if you ever think you're being exploited, just look at the Martian horizon... there's no escape.</i></p>",
